.o-col.o-col--primary
  p.a-subtitle Poll, longer prompt, shows answer
  form.m-poll(action='/endpoints/PollResults.php', data-behavior='Poll', data-poll-show-correct-on-submit='true')
    input(type='hidden', name='pollID', value='2')

    fieldset
      legend.m-poll__legend.m-poll__legend--question.f-body(data-poll-question='')
        | Quisque ut metus elit. Integer pellentesque a magna at convallis. Mauris vulputate non lectus vitae porttitor. Vestibulum sed neque tincidunt, sodales nisi at, aliquam ligula.
        br
        | What is the diagnosis?

      p.m-poll__correct.f-h5(data-poll-correct='', aria-hidden='true') Correct!

      p.m-poll__incorrect.f-h5(data-poll-incorrect='', aria-hidden='true') Incorrect

      p.m-poll__legend.m-poll__legend--answer.f-body(data-poll-answer='', aria-hidden='true')
        | The answer is quis nibh non justo dictum varius. Quisque vel lectus pharetra, consectetur enim at, tincidunt eros. Phasellus varius semper rhoncus. Aliquam erat volutpat. Donec dapibus ornare augue, sit amet placerat orci rhoncus nec.
        a(href='#') Read more
        | .

      ol.m-poll__items
        li
          span.a-form-radio
            input#poll_2_answer_1(type='radio', value='answer_1', name='poll')

            label.m-poll__label(for='poll_2_answer_1')
              | Ischemic hepatitis.
              em.m-poll__label-percentage(data-poll-percentage='')

              span.a-progress-bar
                span(data-poll-bar='')

        li
          span.a-form-radio
            input#poll_2_answer_2(type='radio', value='answer_2', name='poll')

            label.m-poll__label(for='poll_2_answer_2')
              | Wilson&apos;s disease.
              em.m-poll__label-percentage(data-poll-percentage='')

              span.a-progress-bar
                span(data-poll-bar='')

        li
          span.a-form-radio
            input#poll_2_answer_3(type='radio', value='answer_3', name='poll')

            label.m-poll__label(for='poll_2_answer_3')
              | Autoimmune hepatitis.
              em.m-poll__label-percentage(data-poll-percentage='')

              span.a-progress-bar
                span(data-poll-bar='')

        li
          span.a-form-radio
            input#poll_2_answer_4(type='radio', value='answer_4', name='poll')

            label.m-poll__label(for='poll_2_answer_4')
              | Hepatic-vein thrombosis.
              em.m-poll__label-percentage(data-poll-percentage='')

              span.a-progress-bar
                span(data-poll-bar='')

        li
          span.a-form-radio
            input#poll_2_answer_5(type='radio', value='answer_5', name='poll')

            label.m-poll__label(for='poll_2_answer_5')
              | Acute hepatitis E virus infection.
              em.m-poll__label-percentage(data-poll-percentage='')

              span.a-progress-bar
                span(data-poll-bar='')

        li
          span.a-form-radio
            input#poll_2_answer_6(type='radio', value='answer_6', name='poll')

            label.m-poll__label(for='poll_2_answer_6')
              | Hemochromatosis.
              em.m-poll__label-percentage(data-poll-percentage='')

              span.a-progress-bar
                span(data-poll-bar='')

      p.m-poll__btns
        button.a-btn(data-poll-submit='')
          | Submit
          svg.icon--arrow(aria-hidden='true')
            use(xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink', xlink:href='#icon--arrow')

        a.a-btn.a-btn--simple(href='#', data-poll-next-challenge='', aria-hidden='true') Next Challenge

        button.a-btn.a-btn--fake-link(data-poll-view='') How others chose

        button.a-btn.a-btn--fake-link(data-poll-back='', aria-hidden='true') Back to Poll

        span.m-poll__message.m-poll__message--secondary.f-ui(data-poll-responses='', aria-hidden='true')

      p.m-poll__note.f-author
        | This open poll should not be interpreted as a scientifically valid physician survey.
